<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Source-build (Debug) entitlements: no App Sandbox, no app group, no shared
     Keychain group. A build from a clone is its builder's, runs unsandboxed and
     keeps its estate catalog in ~/Library beside the CLI's
     (DECISION_INSTALL_TAKEOVER_2026-09-08). The signed Release build uses the
     sibling file without "-source"; that file is tracked in git and selected by
     CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS in the Release build configuration — xcodegen no
     longer generates it; edit the file, not project.yml. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
</dict>
</plist>
